    <!-- FAQ & Detailed Sizing Guidance Section (From media_1787461024021.md) -->
    <div class="ring-size-faq-section" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 40px auto 60px; padding: 0 24px;">
        <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 32px;">Frequently Asked Questions & Sizing Policies</h2>

        <div class="faq-item-box" style="background: #0b1524; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.25);">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 10px;">Are the jewelry dimensions and sizing measurements on your website precise?</h3>
            <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
                Absolutely. At Sat Jewels, we maintain strict manufacturing tolerances to ensure every sizing specification listed across our store is highly accurate. However, because each piece is individually handcrafted and finished by master artisans, slight micro-variations may naturally occur. To help you select the ideal fit for your ring or chain, we strongly suggest reviewing our comprehensive Sizing Guide prior to ordering.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item-box" style="background: #0b1524; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.25);">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 10px;">How can I determine my correct ring size at home?</h3>
            <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                Finding your exact ring size at home is simple and requires only basic household items. Follow these quick steps:
            </p>
            <ul style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin: 0;">
                <li><strong>Wrap & Fit:</strong> Take a slender strip of paper or a piece of non-stretching string and loop it comfortably around the base of the intended finger.</li>
                <li><strong>Mark the Point:</strong> Use a pen to draw a clear line right where the paper or string overlaps.</li>
                <li><strong>Measure the Length:</strong> Lay the paper flat and measure the distance from the end to your mark against a millimeter ruler. This value gives your finger’s circumference.</li>
                <li><strong>Match with Chart:</strong> Cross-reference your millimeter reading with the official Sat Jewels Ring Size Chart to identify your corresponding US size.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item-box" style="background: #0b1524; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.25);">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 10px;">Can I place an order using my regional or international size metrics?</h3>
            <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
                Yes, certainly! At Sat Jewels, we cater to a global clientele and accept ring sizing in various international standards (including UK, EU, Australian, and Asian sizing). You can easily convert your local measurements using the Sizing Conversion Table provided on our website. If you are unsure about your size equivalent or need guidance, feel free to reach out to our client support team at <a href="mailto:satjewels31@gmail.com" style="color: #d4b270; font-weight: 600;">satjewels31@gmail.com</a>, and we will help you convert it to the exact fit.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item-box" style="background: #0b1524; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.25);">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 10px;">What are the details of your ring re-sizing policy?</h3>
            <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                At Sat Jewels, your comfort and satisfaction are our top priorities. If your newly delivered ring requires a slight fit adjustment, we provide a complimentary one-time resizing service within 30 days of receiving your order.
            </p>
            <ul style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 12px;">
                <li><strong>Adjustment Range:</strong> We can safely adjust most standard ring mountings by up to 1 full size up or down (+/- 1 US size).</li>
                <li><strong>Special Design Exceptions:</strong> Please note that certain full-eternity bands, intricate pavé styles, or specialized metal settings cannot be resized without altering the structural integrity of the piece. For non-resizable designs, our team will discuss suitable alternative modification options with you.</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
                <strong>How to Initiate:</strong> To arrange a sizing adjustment, simply connect with our dedicated support staff at <a href="mailto:satjewels31@gmail.com" style="color: #d4b270; font-weight: 600;">satjewels31@gmail.com</a> for step-by-step guidance.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item-box" style="background: #0b1524; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.25);">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 10px;">How can I receive personal assistance to identify my exact ring size?</h3>
            <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
                Our specialist team at Sat Jewels is always available to ensure you get a flawless fit before placing your custom order. If you need step-by-step guidance, measurement verification, or size conversion help, you can reach out directly to our client concierges via email at <a href="mailto:satjewels31@gmail.com" style="color: #d4b270; font-weight: 600;">satjewels31@gmail.com</a>. Additionally, you can book a one-on-one virtual consultation with our jewelry experts to review your measurements and select your precise size in real time.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

